  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Attempt to link the script&#39;s object with <b>target</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>TargetPrim / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/target" target="_blank">target</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Prim" target="_blank">prim</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Parent / parent</td>
          <td>If <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a>, then <b>target</b> becomes the root. If <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a>, then the script&#39;s object becomes the root.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
